    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The &#8216;Variation Restrictions&#8217; WooCommerce plugin allows you to completely hide variations and prodcuts according to user roles or countries.</p>\n<p>You can make variations unselectable based on user roles or countries.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide Variations by User Roles.</li>\n<li>Hide Variations by countries.</li>\n<li>Completely hide or make variations un-selectable.</li>\n<li>Create custom user roles with popular user-role-editor plugin.</li>\n<li>Create rule to hide products.</li>\n<li>Hide product by User Roles.</li>\n<li>Hide product by countries.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Installation procedure:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download variation-restrictions plugin.</li>\n<li>Extract &#8220;variation-restrictions.zip&#8221; archive content to the &#8220;/wp-content/plugins/user-role-editor&#8221; directory.</li>\n<li>Activate &#8220;variation-restrictions&#8221; plugin via &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress admin menu.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "<p>– Does it work with WordPress in multi-site environment?<br />\nYes, it works with WordPress multi-site with one instance of WooCommerce installed.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2025-03-18 &#8211; version 2.2.2</h4>\n<p>Add &#8211; change log file</p>\n<h4>2025-03-17 &#8211; version 2.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Feature -add end and start date. </li>\n<li>Feature -add weekdays. </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix -Compatible with WooCommerce High-Performance Order Storage (HPOS).</li>\n<li>Fix &#8211; fix critical errors. </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fix error. </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Admin can hide product and variation on front end .</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Manage WooCommerce product variation based on user roles, country,weekdays, start and end date.",
    "description": "<p>The &#8216;Variation Restrictions&#8217; WooCommerce plugin allows you to completely hide variations and prodcuts according to user roles or countries.</p>\n<p>You can make variations unselectable based on user roles or countries.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Hide Variations by User Roles.</li>\n<li>Hide Variations by countries.</li>\n<li>Completely hide or make variations un-selectable.</li>\n<li>Create custom user roles with popular user-role-editor plugin.</li>\n<li>Create rule to hide products.</li>\n<li>Hide product by User Roles.</li>\n<li>Hide product by countries.</li>\n</ul>\n",
